          <title locale="en">On the Reproducibility of Coin Flips in Laboratory Settings</title>
          <abstract locale="en">
            Two hundred coin flips were performed under controlled conditions and then repeated
            by an independent team. Agreement was approximately what chance would predict, which
            we interpret as encouraging.
          </abstract>
