          <title locale="en">Lorem Ipsum as a Research Instrument: A Critical Review</title>
          <abstract locale="en">
            Placeholder text has shaped the layout of scholarly publishing for decades while
            remaining entirely unexamined as an object of study. We review its history and
            propose a research agenda nobody asked for.
          </abstract>
