          <title locale="en">Counting to Ten: Methodological Considerations</title>
          <abstract locale="en">
            Counting to ten is widely practised but rarely documented. We describe a protocol,
            report inter-rater reliability, and discuss the two cases in which our counters
            disagreed.
          </abstract>
